01:00:33.262 --> 01:00:35.355
You're skinnier than
my six-year-old daughter.


01:00:35.398 --> 01:00:38.128
You need to bulk up.
Build muscle.


01:00:40.903 --> 01:00:42.097
You're a good prospect, Daniel.


01:00:43.172 --> 01:00:47.199
But if you join the team
you'll need something special.


01:00:47.243 --> 01:00:48.676
What's that?


01:00:49.278 --> 01:00:50.404
Commitment?


01:00:52.815 --> 01:00:54.077
You're not as dumb as you look.


01:00:54.751 --> 01:00:55.843
Pay attention.


01:00:56.252 --> 01:01:01.053
No partying, no smoking, and
no girlfriends.


01:01:03.126 --> 01:01:05.060
This is a good first contract.


01:01:06.663 --> 01:01:08.096
You won't have to work.


01:01:08.131 --> 01:01:11.225
But once you sign,
your life will be ours.


01:01:13.670 --> 01:01:16.161
What about school?
He's still in high school.


01:01:16.205 --> 01:01:18.139
We'll let him finish school.


01:01:18.174 --> 01:01:21.940
One day he might have to
read his own contracts.


01:01:24.147 --> 01:01:25.808
What about my brother?


01:01:27.383 --> 01:01:28.407
He's better than me.


01:01:28.451 --> 01:01:31.818
Who, the brawler? The one
who walked out during the tryout?


01:01:33.056 --> 01:01:34.956
Come to the game on Sunday.


01:01:35.391 --> 01:01:37.689
It's the final,
you can watch us play.


01:01:37.727 --> 01:01:41.254
My brother is the captain of our team
and the best player in the league.


01:01:41.297 --> 01:01:44.164
That way you can put two names
on the contract instead of one.


01:01:44.934 --> 01:01:48.802
What you're saying
is that you want two contracts?


01:01:48.838 --> 01:01:51.068
-Yes.
-Two contracts or none?


01:01:51.107 --> 01:01:51.971
No.


01:01:52.709 --> 01:01:54.472
You've got some guts.
I was wrong.


01:01:54.977 --> 01:01:57.445
You are much,
much dumber than I imagined.


01:01:57.480 --> 01:02:00.881
No, Daniel. Think it through.
Sign that contract.


01:02:03.786 --> 01:02:06.755
Very well. Double or nothing then.


01:02:07.123 --> 01:02:10.115
You and your brother will have
to play really well on Sunday.


01:02:10.159 --> 01:02:12.821
Because if I go to see you,
and you don't win...


01:02:12.862 --> 01:02:14.386
You won't see this again.


01:02:16.899 --> 01:02:18.730
We're unbeatable together.


01:02:23.906 --> 01:02:25.066
See you Sunday.


01:02:28.077 --> 01:02:31.046
-Thank you.
-Thank you.


01:02:54.070 --> 01:02:56.868
-What's happening?
-Justice.


01:03:01.110 --> 01:03:04.204
Nelson Guerra is coming to the final.
If we win, we get to play for Caracas.


01:03:04.247 --> 01:03:06.511
-I don't play football.
-Where are you going?


01:03:07.450 --> 01:03:09.042
I know who killed her.


01:03:47.557 --> 01:03:50.025
Where are you going, cocksucker?
Where are you going?


01:03:50.059 --> 01:03:51.458
Tell him you killed her,
motherfucker.


01:03:52.094 --> 01:03:54.221
Tell him you killed her
and I won't let him kill you.


01:03:54.263 --> 01:03:57.130
I already paid.
I haven't killed anyone.


01:03:57.166 --> 01:03:58.827
-Talk, you bastard.
-Do it, brother.


01:03:58.868 --> 01:04:01.098
He's lying to your face, man.


01:04:01.137 --> 01:04:03.071
-He killed your mom.
-I haven't killed anyone.


01:04:03.105 --> 01:04:06.165
Tell him, cocksucker.
Tell him you killed her.


01:04:06.209 --> 01:04:08.109
Tell and I won't let him kill you.


01:04:08.144 --> 01:04:12.012
-Tell him.
-Speak!


01:04:12.048 --> 01:04:14.448
This motherfucker
murdered her like trash.


01:04:14.483 --> 01:04:16.474
-Brother, don't be a murderer.
-Get out!


01:04:16.519 --> 01:04:18.282
No Julio! Don't be a murderer!


01:04:18.321 --> 01:04:20.050
-You know it wasn't him.
-Get out of the fucking way!


01:04:20.089 --> 01:04:21.556
You're not a killer,
you're my brother.


01:04:21.591 --> 01:04:24.025
-I don't care, get out of the way!
-You know it wasn't him!


01:04:30.433 --> 01:04:32.628
You little fuck! You took it from me.


01:04:42.612 --> 01:04:45.638
-You've fucked everything up.
-You fucked it up.


01:04:46.249 --> 01:04:48.547
I gave your brother what he needed:
his revenge.


01:04:48.584 --> 01:04:50.484
You think I'm talking about this mess?


01:04:51.921 --> 01:04:54.913
I saw you. I saw you in the alley
when you killed her.


01:04:57.360 --> 01:04:59.089
When you killed her.


01:05:03.065 --> 01:05:04.555
I didn't see your mom show up.


01:05:04.600 --> 01:05:08.036
I swear. I was helping you
because you shit your pants.


01:05:09.505 --> 01:05:11.268
Get away from us.


01:05:11.607 --> 01:05:14.508
Or I'll kill you myself.
I swear I'll kill you.


01:05:20.983 --> 01:05:23.611
Go ahead.
You won't be able to cover this one.


01:05:24.687 --> 01:05:25.483
Do it!


01:05:32.528 --> 01:05:34.018
I loved her too, man.


01:05:34.430 --> 01:05:37.092
If you loved her so much,
leave us alone.


01:05:38.200 --> 01:05:40.998
I don't want my brother
to know either, but leave us alone.


01:05:42.071 --> 01:05:43.060
Stay away.


01:05:46.275 --> 01:05:48.334
Are you going through all this shit
just to make a football team?


01:06:26.749 --> 01:06:28.148
First to three.


01:08:13.823 --> 01:08:15.347
Two-one.


01:08:15.724 --> 01:08:18.557
If I win, you have to play in the final.


01:08:52.128 --> 01:08:55.427
-Ma doesn't want a murderer for a son.
-You don't give a fuck about Ma.


01:08:55.464 --> 01:08:58.194
Stupid! Idiot! Asshole!


01:08:59.301 --> 01:09:02.134
Ma saved my life.
I owe her everything.


01:09:02.838 --> 01:09:04.237
She wants you alive.


01:09:04.840 --> 01:09:06.398
She deserves justice.


01:09:07.710 --> 01:09:09.541
You're gonna die!


01:09:09.845 --> 01:09:12.678
That's not justice! That's stupidity!


01:09:14.683 --> 01:09:16.651
Fuck off, you little shit.


01:09:17.286 --> 01:09:18.548
Play the fucking game!


01:09:18.587 --> 01:09:20.748
This is the first time in my life
that I have a chance to beat you.


01:09:21.924 --> 01:09:24.290
If I win,
you get the fuck out of the house.


01:10:15.945 --> 01:10:17.276
You know what, Julio?


01:10:18.214 --> 01:10:21.479
When we play together, it's
the best time of my life, brother.


01:10:24.787 --> 01:10:25.481
Goal!


01:10:58.387 --> 01:11:00.821
The smell of her cakes is fading,
brother.


01:11:25.714 --> 01:11:28.376
-You wanna shower first?
-No, you go ahead.


01:12:06.088 --> 01:12:07.419
Cat.


01:12:09.958 --> 01:12:11.323
Come.


01:12:42.925 --> 01:12:43.914
To Mama.


01:12:58.640 --> 01:13:00.608
You'll get used to it
by the time we finish the bottle.


01:13:09.752 --> 01:13:10.878
You were a gift.


01:13:19.094 --> 01:13:22.757
You wanna dance?
Or is your leg still fucked up?


01:13:22.798 --> 01:13:23.765
I'm in.


01:13:42.451 --> 01:13:43.418
Go for it.


01:13:46.188 --> 01:13:47.951
You are a freak, man.


01:14:04.173 --> 01:14:07.609
Take it, bro!


01:14:15.918 --> 01:14:18.648
Take it, bro!


01:14:19.488 --> 01:14:23.185
What a goal!


01:14:32.634 --> 01:14:34.761
Save me a seat next
to you on the bus.


01:14:34.803 --> 01:14:35.565
Hey.


01:14:36.171 --> 01:14:37.138
See you.


01:15:02.498 --> 01:15:03.487
What's that?


01:15:05.100 --> 01:15:07.568
-Are you coming to the game?
-No.


01:15:07.603 --> 01:15:09.195
I called my mom
and told her everything.


01:15:09.238 --> 01:15:11.035
-I'm going back to Barinas today.
-Today?


01:15:13.609 --> 01:15:16.669
-And the baby?
-I'm going to have it.


01:15:17.112 --> 01:15:18.670
Then see what happens.


01:15:20.916 --> 01:15:23.783
I'll visit you. You and the baby.


01:15:25.287 --> 01:15:26.276
I hate you.


01:15:27.756 --> 01:15:28.723
I love you.


01:15:43.672 --> 01:15:45.264
I wish you were the father.


01:16:06.929 --> 01:16:07.896
How's the hand?


01:16:10.198 --> 01:16:11.324
Ready to crack skulls.


01:16:12.568 --> 01:16:13.626
Go on then.


01:16:13.669 --> 01:16:16.137
Destroy those fuckers
and bring that trophy to the barrio.


01:16:55.911 --> 01:16:56.900
Guys.


01:16:59.214 --> 01:17:02.149
Whatever happens today,
to me, you are already champions.


01:17:02.851 --> 01:17:06.082
You achieved something
beautiful for our barrio.


01:17:06.121 --> 01:17:07.110
Hope.


01:17:09.358 --> 01:17:12.725
So when things get ugly out there,


01:17:12.761 --> 01:17:15.992
remember that you have each other.


01:17:17.399 --> 01:17:20.061
-Let's win.
-Come on!


01:17:25.340 --> 01:17:28.002
Let's go.


01:18:41.183 --> 01:18:42.343
Over here.


01:19:59.828 --> 01:20:01.125
Fuck!


01:21:19.241 --> 01:21:21.937
Guys, come here.


01:21:23.011 --> 01:21:24.308
Come on, let's go, come here.


01:21:34.522 --> 01:21:36.615
Life will always score goals
against us.


01:21:38.660 --> 01:21:41.493
That's why every single day
we need to get up


01:21:41.529 --> 01:21:45.295
convinced that the game
is still zero-zero.


01:21:46.501 --> 01:21:48.230
Otherwise we're fucked, right?


01:21:50.472 --> 01:21:51.598
Zero-zero, guys.


01:21:54.175 --> 01:21:56.075
Zero-zero.


01:21:58.480 --> 01:22:01.244
Look around you. Look at each other.


01:22:03.385 --> 01:22:05.216
You are family.


01:22:06.688 --> 01:22:08.155
Brothers.


01:22:09.224 --> 01:22:11.158
Zero-zero.


01:22:12.928 --> 01:22:15.158
In the next forty-five minutes,


01:22:16.398 --> 01:22:19.458
you will give everything
for your family.


01:22:23.705 --> 01:22:24.433
Julio.


01:22:39.187 --> 01:22:43.055
Come on! Yeah.


01:22:56.171 --> 01:22:57.138
Something's changed.


01:23:20.996 --> 01:23:23.157
-Come back, come back.
-Here, here.


01:23:41.116 --> 01:23:42.208
Goal!


01:23:55.597 --> 01:23:58.327
Let's put pressure on number 10.


01:23:58.366 --> 01:24:00.357
Not number 18, number 10. Okay?


01:24:10.779 --> 01:24:14.408
Come on, Ceniza!


01:24:15.483 --> 01:24:17.110
Don't turn your back to the ball.


01:24:18.820 --> 01:24:20.617
Get in there.


01:24:20.655 --> 01:24:22.782
Come on, cover that man.


01:24:40.642 --> 01:24:42.542
-What is that?
-Dangerous play, sir.


01:24:42.577 --> 01:24:45.205
What the fuck are you ruling?
A penalty kick?


01:24:45.246 --> 01:24:47.544
Come on, bro.
It's not over yet. We still need you.


01:24:49.184 --> 01:24:51.550
Coach! Coach!


01:24:52.821 --> 01:24:54.618
Calm down, take it easy.


01:24:55.323 --> 01:24:57.314
-He just threw up.
-Can you get up?


01:25:01.229 --> 01:25:03.220
You're fucked, dude.


01:25:05.834 --> 01:25:07.768
-Stop that penalty kick.
-Yeah?


01:25:08.870 --> 01:25:11.361
What if I don't?
Are you gonna stop it.


01:25:18.346 --> 01:25:19.404
That's what I thought.


01:25:22.317 --> 01:25:23.181
""Superstar"".


01:26:02.891 --> 01:26:05.382
Sub me out, Coach. You need fresh legs.


01:26:05.426 --> 01:26:08.486
No way man. We need our captain.


01:26:13.334 --> 01:26:14.460
Now you're in charge.


01:26:20.341 --> 01:26:22.901
Fix him, Coach. Two contracts or none.


01:26:23.811 --> 01:26:24.800
Fix him.


01:27:13.228 --> 01:27:14.217
That was shit.


01:27:23.471 --> 01:27:26.702
Daniel is right. I can't replace you.


01:27:28.376 --> 01:27:29.673
You have to get drafted.


01:27:32.747 --> 01:27:34.942
Look at him. Look at him.


01:27:37.752 --> 01:27:40.880
You have no idea what that kid
has done to get you here.


01:27:42.323 --> 01:27:43.312
What's he done?


01:27:46.394 --> 01:27:47.884
We all have secrets, Julio.


01:27:49.931 --> 01:27:52.764
Daniel kept his because he loves you.


01:28:20.495 --> 01:28:22.793
-Do you love me, brother?
-You're my brother.


01:28:22.830 --> 01:28:23.660
Am l?


01:28:24.332 --> 01:28:26.596
Come on, we still have time,
let's win this.


01:29:01.703 --> 01:29:04.866
We've still got time.
Let's do this. Come on.


01:29:28.363 --> 01:29:29.887
Goal! That's it!


01:29:35.770 --> 01:29:38.967
You knew.
You knew and you didn't tell me.


01:29:43.511 --> 01:29:44.808
I did it for us.


01:29:47.882 --> 01:29:49.110
You killed me, man.


01:29:49.751 --> 01:29:51.912
You wanted your dream?
There it is, you've got it.


01:29:54.021 --> 01:29:56.455
-But you lost a brother.
-Julio, brother.


01:29:56.858 --> 01:29:58.917
-Julio.
-We should've left you in the trash.


01:30:05.833 --> 01:30:07.824
There's still time.


01:31:58.145 --> 01:32:00.136
They killed him!


01:32:02.250 --> 01:32:04.241
Leave him!

